  logforward alpine-several ------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Decided: no Figma frame. web-01.example.net runs Alpine 3.23.$
# busybox syslogd forwards to two servers, one -R each, set by$
# hardn.$
$
# Syslog Settings ##############################################$
$
  [+] Syslog               Configured 2 servers$
$
  Forwarding ---------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Logger               busybox syslogd$
  [ ] Server               192.0.2.51:514 UDP losses unseen$
  [ ] Server               192.0.2.52:514 UDP losses unseen$
   -  File                 /etc/conf.d/syslog$
   -  Set by               hardn$
   -  hardn.yml            2 servers$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Stop forwarding      Undo hardn's change$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-1 or q]:$
$
$

